#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:2
msgid "VM Lifecycle on Clusters"
msgstr "VM Lifecycle en Clusters"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:5
msgid "Live Migration"
msgstr "Live Migration"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:7
msgid ""
"Live migration moves a running VM from one cluster host to another with no "
"downtime to the guest operating system."
msgstr ""
"Live migración moves un ejecutando VM desde one cluster host a another con "
"no downtime al guest sistema operativo."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:10
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "Requisitos"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:12
msgid "The VM must be running (powered on)"
msgstr "El VM debe be ejecutando (powered en)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:13
msgid ""
"The VM's storage must reside on a shared datastore (HPE Clustered Datastore "
"or NFS). VMs with local storage cannot be live-migrated"
msgstr ""
"El VM's storage debe reside en un shared datastore (HPE Clustered Almacén de"
" datos o NFS). VMs con local storage cannot be live-migrado"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:14
msgid "No host devices (GPU/USB passthrough) are attached to the VM"
msgstr "No host devices (GPU/USB passthrough) son adjunto un el VM"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:15
msgid "The target host must have sufficient available memory"
msgstr "El destino host debe tienen sufficient disponible memoria"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:16
msgid "Network connectivity between source and target hosts"
msgstr "Red connectivity entre origen y destino hosts"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:19
msgid "Initiating a Live Migration"
msgstr "Initiating un Live Migración"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:21
msgid ""
"Navigate to ``Infrastructure > Clusters > [Cluster] > Virtual Machines``"
msgstr ""
"Navegue un ``Infrastructure > Clusters > [Cluster] > Virtual Machines``"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:22
msgid "Select the VM to migrate"
msgstr "Seleccionar el VM a migrate"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:23
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Actions` > :guilabel:`Move`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`Acciones` > :guilabel:`Mover`"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:24
msgid "Select the target host from the available hosts list"
msgstr "Seleccionar el destino host desde el disponible hosts lista"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:25
msgid "Confirm the migration"
msgstr "Confirmar el migración"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:27
msgid ""
"|morpheus| automatically determines whether to perform a live or cold "
"migration based on the VM's current power state and storage configuration."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| automáticamente determines whether a perform un live o cold "
"migración basado en el VM's actual power estado y storage configuración."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:30
msgid "What Happens During Live Migration"
msgstr "Qué Happens Durante Live Migration"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:32
msgid ""
"A migration lock is acquired to prevent concurrent migrations of the same VM"
msgstr ""
"Un migración lock es acquired a prevent concurrent migrations del mismo VM"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:33
msgid ""
"Storage pools are refreshed on the target host to ensure it can access the "
"VM's disks"
msgstr ""
"Almacenamiento pools son refreshed en el destino host a asegurar it puede "
"acceso el VM's discos"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:34
msgid ""
"Network preparation ensures the target host has the correct bridge "
"configurations"
msgstr ""
"Red preparation ensures el destino host tiene el correct bridge "
"configurations"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:35
msgid ""
"The ``virsh migrate`` command executes, transferring the VM's memory state "
"to the target host"
msgstr ""
"El ``virsh migrate`` command executes, transferring el VM's memoria estado "
"al destino host"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:36
msgid ""
"Upon completion, the VM's parent host reference is updated in |morpheus|"
msgstr ""
"Upon completion, el VM's parent host reference es actualizado en |morpheus|"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:37
msgid "The migration lock is released"
msgstr "El migración lock es released"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:40
msgid "Migration Options"
msgstr "Migration Options"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:46
msgid "Option"
msgstr "Option"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:47
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:126
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:149
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Descripción"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:48
msgid "Migration Timeout"
msgstr "Migration Timeout"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:49
msgid ""
"Maximum time allowed for the migration to complete before it is cancelled"
msgstr ""
"Máximo tiempo permitido para el migración a completo antes de it es "
"cancelled"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:50
msgid "CPU Throttling"
msgstr "CPU Throttling"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:51
msgid ""
"When enabled, throttles the VM's CPU during migration to help convergence "
"for memory-intensive workloads"
msgstr ""
"Cuando está habilitado, throttles el VM's CPU durante migración a help "
"convergence para memoria-intensive cargas de trabajo"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:54
msgid "Cold Migration"
msgstr "Cold Migration"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:56
msgid ""
"Cold migration moves a powered-off VM to a different host. This is used "
"when:"
msgstr ""
"Cold migración moves un powered-off VM a un diferente host. Este es "
"utilizado cuando:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:58
msgid "The VM is powered off"
msgstr "El VM es powered off"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:59
msgid "The VM has local storage that cannot be live-migrated"
msgstr "El VM tiene local storage ese cannot be live-migrado"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:60
msgid "Live migration failed and the VM was subsequently powered off"
msgstr "Live migración falló y el VM fue subsequently powered off"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:62
msgid ""
"For cold migration, the VM's XML definition is relocated and storage volumes"
" (if local) are copied to the target host."
msgstr ""
"Para cold migración, el VM's XML definition es relocated y storage volúmenes"
" (si local) son copied al destino host."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:65
msgid "VM Pinning"
msgstr "VM Pinning"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:67
msgid ""
"VM pinning prevents a VM from being automatically migrated by maintenance "
"mode evacuation or Dynamic Resource Scheduling (DRS). Pinned VMs remain on "
"their assigned host unless manually moved by an administrator."
msgstr ""
"VM pinning prevents un VM desde being automáticamente migrado por "
"mantenimiento modo evacuation o Dinámico Recurso Scheduling (DRS). Pinned "
"VMs remain en su asignado host unless manualmente moved por un "
"administrator."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:70
msgid "Use Cases"
msgstr "Usar Cases"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:72
msgid ""
"VMs with host-level hardware dependencies (GPU passthrough, USB devices)"
msgstr ""
"VMs con host-nivel hardware dependencies (GPU passthrough, USB devices)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:73
msgid "License-bound VMs that must run on specific hosts"
msgstr "License-bound VMs ese debe ejecutar en específico hosts"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:74
msgid "VMs with local storage that cannot be migrated"
msgstr "VMs con local storage ese cannot be migrado"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:75
msgid "System VMs (cluster management agents)"
msgstr "Sistema VMs (cluster gestión agents)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:78
msgid "Behavior of Pinned VMs"
msgstr "Behavior de Pinned VMs"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:84
msgid "Scenario"
msgstr "Scenario"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:85
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:107
msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "Behavior"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:86
msgid "Maintenance mode"
msgstr "Mantenimiento modo"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:87
msgid "Pinned VMs are skipped during evacuation"
msgstr "Pinned VMs son skipped durante evacuation"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:88
msgid "DRS rebalancing"
msgstr "DRS rebalancing"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:89
msgid "Pinned VMs are excluded from placement calculations"
msgstr "Pinned VMs son excluded desde placement calculations"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:90
msgid "Host failure"
msgstr "Host fallo"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:91
msgid "Pinned VMs are **not** automatically failed over to another host"
msgstr "Pinned VMs son **not** automáticamente falló sobre a another host"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:92
msgid "Manual migration"
msgstr "Manual migración"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:93
msgid "Pinned VMs can be manually moved by an administrator"
msgstr "Pinned VMs puede be manually moved por un administrator"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:95
msgid ""
"Pinned VMs on a failed host will not be automatically recovered. If the host"
" fails, the pinned VM remains offline until the host recovers or an "
"administrator manually intervenes."
msgstr ""
"Pinned VMs en un falló host será no be automáticamente recovered. Si el host"
" falla, el pinned VM remains offline hasta el host recovers o un "
"administrator manualmente intervenes."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:98
msgid "Placement Strategy"
msgstr "Placement Strategy"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:100
msgid ""
"Each VM has a placement strategy that determines how |morpheus| handles its "
"host assignment:"
msgstr ""
"Cada VM tiene un placement strategy ese determines cómo |morpheus| handles "
"su host assignment:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:106
msgid "Strategy"
msgstr "Strategy"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:108
msgid "Auto (default)"
msgstr "Auto (predeterminado)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:109
msgid ""
"VM may be moved by DRS, maintenance mode, or failover. The preferred host is"
" updated when the VM is migrated."
msgstr ""
"VM puede be moved por DRS, mantenimiento modo, o conmutación por error. El "
"preferred host es actualizado cuando el VM es migrado."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:110
msgid "Pinned"
msgstr "Pinned"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:111
msgid ""
"VM is locked to its current host. Only manual migration by an administrator "
"can relocate it."
msgstr ""
"VM es locked a su actual host. Solo manual migración por un administrator "
"puede relocate it."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:114
msgid "Dynamic Resource Scheduling (DRS)"
msgstr "Dinámico Recurso Scheduling (DRS)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:116
msgid ""
"DRS automatically balances VM placement across cluster hosts based on "
"resource utilization. DRS runs during each cluster sync cycle."
msgstr ""
"DRS automáticamente balances VM placement a través de cluster hosts basado "
"en recurso utilization. DRS ejecuta durante cada cluster sync cycle."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:119
msgid "Modes"
msgstr "Modes"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:125
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Modo"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:127
msgid "Failover Only (default)"
msgstr "Conmutación por error Solo (predeterminado)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:128
msgid ""
"DRS only moves VMs when a host has failed and VMs need to be restarted on "
"surviving hosts"
msgstr ""
"DRS solo moves VMs cuando un host tiene falló y VMs necesita a be reiniciado"
" en surviving hosts"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:129
msgid "Dynamic Placement"
msgstr "Dinámico Placement"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:130
msgid ""
"DRS actively rebalances VMs across hosts to distribute memory utilization "
"evenly"
msgstr ""
"DRS actively rebalances VMs a través de hosts a distribute memoria "
"utilization evenly"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:132
msgid "DRS respects:"
msgstr "DRS respects:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:134
msgid "VM pinning (pinned VMs are never moved by DRS)"
msgstr "VM pinning (pinned VMs son nunca moved por DRS)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:135
msgid "Maintenance mode flags (hosts in maintenance are excluded)"
msgstr "Mantenimiento modo flags (hosts en mantenimiento son excluded)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:136
msgid "Host-VM Group affinity and anti-affinity rules"
msgstr "Host-VM Grupo affinity y anti-affinity reglas"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:137
msgid "Available memory thresholds"
msgstr "Disponible memoria thresholds"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:140
msgid "Host-VM Groups (Affinity/Anti-Affinity)"
msgstr "Host-VM Grupos (Affinity/Anti-Affinity)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:142
msgid ""
"Host-VM Groups define rules that control which hosts a VM may run on. These "
"are configured at the cluster level and enforced during provisioning, "
"migration, and DRS operations."
msgstr ""
"Host-VM Grupos define reglas ese control cual hosts un VM puede ejecutar en."
" Estos están configurados en el cluster nivel y enforced durante "
"provisioning, migración, y DRS operaciones."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:148
msgid "Group Type"
msgstr "Group Tipo"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:150
msgid "Affinity"
msgstr "Affinity"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:151
msgid ""
"VMs in this group should run on the specified hosts. DRS will migrate non-"
"compliant VMs to the preferred host when it has available capacity."
msgstr ""
"VMs en este group debería ejecutar en el specified hosts. DRS será migrate "
"non-compliant VMs al preferred host cuando it tiene disponible capacidad."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:152
msgid "Anti-Affinity"
msgstr "Anti-Affinity"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:153
msgid ""
"VMs in this group should NOT run on the same host. Ensures high availability"
" by distributing replicas."
msgstr ""
"VMs en este group debería NOT ejecutar en el mismo host. Ensures alta "
"disponibilidad por distributing replicas."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:154
msgid "Site Group"
msgstr "Site Group"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:155
msgid ""
"Groups hosts and VMs by physical site/location. Used in stretch cluster "
"configurations for site-aware placement."
msgstr ""
"Grupos hosts y VMs por physical site/location. Used en stretch cluster "
"configurations para site-aware placement."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:157
msgid ""
"For detailed instructions on creating and managing Host-VM Groups, see "
":doc:`../host_vm_groups`."
msgstr ""
"Para detailed instructions en creating y managing Host-VM Grupos, ver "
":doc:`../host_vm_groups`."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:160
msgid "DRS and Affinity Enforcement"
msgstr "DRS y Affinity Enforcement"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:162
msgid ""
"When DRS runs with dynamic placement enabled, it evaluates affinity groups:"
msgstr ""
"Cuando DRS ejecuta con dinámico placement habilitado, it evaluates grupos de"
" afinidad:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:164
msgid ""
"VMs in an **affinity group** that are not on their preferred host are "
"migrated back (if the preferred host is online and has capacity)"
msgstr ""
"VMs en un **grupo de afinidad** ese son no en su preferred host son migrado "
"back (si el preferred host es online y tiene capacidad)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:165
msgid ""
"VMs in an **anti-affinity group** that violate the rule (running on the same"
" host as another group member) are migrated to separate hosts"
msgstr ""
"VMs en un **anti-grupo de afinidad** ese violate el regla (ejecutando en el "
"mismo host como another group miembro) son migrado a separate hosts"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:167
msgid ""
"Affinity rules are best-effort. If enforcing a rule would exceed host "
"capacity or violate other constraints, the VM remains in its current "
"location until conditions allow compliance."
msgstr ""
"Affinity reglas son best-effort. Si enforcing un regla would exceed host "
"capacidad o violate otro constraints, el VM remains en su actual location "
"hasta conditions permitir compliance."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:170
msgid "VM Failover Behavior"
msgstr "VM Failover Behavior"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:172
msgid ""
"When a host fails (detected after 140 seconds of missed heartbeat writes), "
"the Designated Coordinator assigns the failed host's VMs to surviving hosts:"
msgstr ""
"Cuando un host falla (detectado después de 140 seconds de missed heartbeat "
"writes), el Designated Coordinator asigna el falló host's VMs a surviving "
"hosts:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:174
msgid ""
"VMs are assigned to hosts based on available memory (most available memory "
"first)"
msgstr ""
"VMs son asignado un hosts basado en disponible memoria (más disponible "
"memoria primero)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:175
msgid "Only VMs with ``auto`` placement strategy are failed over"
msgstr "Solo VMs con ``auto`` placement strategy son falló sobre"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:176
msgid "Pinned VMs are not automatically restarted"
msgstr "Pinned VMs son no automatically restarted"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:177
msgid ""
"VM XML definitions from the heartbeat directory are used to restart VMs on "
"their assigned hosts"
msgstr ""
"VM XML definitions desde el heartbeat directory se usan para reiniciar VMs "
"en su asignado hosts"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_operations.rst:179
msgid ""
"For detailed failover timelines and scenarios, see :doc:`failure_scenarios`."
msgstr ""
"Para detailed conmutación por error timelines y scenarios, ver "
":doc:`failure_scenarios`."
